 would have been, "Sive, man."

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:38.360
 "Sive, man, it does."

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.440
 "Sive, man, it helps with coal mine stuff."

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:41.000
 When was the sieve around?

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.000
 When was the sieve?

