 So there was a thing called the pre-Dougalvanisme,

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.120
 created in 1801, by Napoleon Bonaparte,

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:34.160
 which was a prize for scientific advances.

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.160
 He had won it, and in 1813--

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:40.000
 so really, Napoleon's master of Moscow

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.800
 has just ended catastrophically.

00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:43.360
 We're gearing up for Waterloo.

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:45.760
 It's a great time.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:48.040
 Davey and his wife, Jaina Priest,

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:51.360
 and Faraday went to Brittany to present themselves

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:54.440
 to Napoleon to pick up the medal and the track.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:56.800
 They were arrested mistakenly when they got there.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.120
 So this was quite a perilous trip they made,

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:02.000
 but they did make it, got the gong and the money and all of that.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.480
 But there was a really big appeal a few years ago

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:07.320
 by the Royal Society of Chemistry saying, where is this medal?

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:10.160
 And it turned out that Jane, his widow,

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:13.440
 had been so embarrassed to have this French medal

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.880
 and the French money in the house

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:18.800
 that she had hurled it into the sea off the Cornish coast

00:24:18.800 --> 00:24:19.760
 after he died.

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:21.120
 They knew roughly where they had done it,

00:24:21.120 --> 00:24:23.600
 and they spent four days diving in--

00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:25.320
 I think it was 2013.

00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:26.120
 They did this.

00:24:26.120 --> 00:24:27.120
 Really?

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:29.040
 Well, 2014, yeah, they didn't find it, obviously, because, you know--

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:31.040
 Sorry, it's very hard to find, yeah, yeah.

00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:32.040
 Yeah, but it looked--

00:24:32.040 --> 00:24:33.040
 So it might be out there.

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:34.040
 There still might be--

00:24:34.040 --> 00:24:35.040
 It's still definitely out there.

00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:36.040
 Wow, the Davy treasure.

00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:37.040
 That's cool.

00:24:37.040 --> 00:24:37.040
 Find it.

00:24:37.040 --> 00:24:38.040
 Go and find it.

