 Sometimes you would be standing by the window during the day

00:30:12.160 --> 00:30:13.120
 and you couldn't read a book.

00:30:13.680 --> 00:30:16.240
 I mean, it was, it was so foggy, it was, it was cold.

00:30:16.240 --> 00:30:18.480
 Basically, every home was heated by coal.

00:30:18.480 --> 00:30:20.240
 There were big coal power plants in the centre of town.

00:30:20.240 --> 00:30:21.280
 It was cold, cold, cold.

00:30:21.280 --> 00:30:24.000
 But the cool thing was, fog changed colour.

00:30:24.000 --> 00:30:26.560
 You could tell what time of day it was by the colour of the fog.

